 porque no te dejaré hasta tanto que haya hecho lo que te he dicho.", "words": [[0, 135129], [2, 135289], [5, 135389], [11, 135729], [14, 136009], [18, 136269], [27, 136969], [29, 137249], [32, 137389], [41, 137889], [45, 138069], [51, 138269], [58, 138649], [62, 138809], [69, 139349], [71, 139629], [74, 139749], [82, 140209], [84, 140309], [89, 140509], [97, 141403], [104, 141579], [107, 141759], [110, 141899], [117, 142319], [123, 142499], [129, 142959], [133, 143139], [138, 143319], [144, 143619], [147, 143759], [151, 143879], [154, 144039], [157, 144139]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 145169, "end": 152250, "text": "Y despertó Jacob de su sueño, y dijo: Ciertamente Jehová está en este lugar, y yo no lo sabía.", "words": [[0, 145169], [2, 145294], [11, 145994], [17, 146274], [20, 146694], [23, 146874], [30, 147574], [32, 147654], [38, 148411], [50, 148879], [57, 149379], [62, 149659], [65, 149839], [70, 150019], [77, 150359], [79, 150739], [82, 150919], [85, 151079], [88, 151179]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 152530, "end": 159701, "text": "Y tuvo miedo, y dijo: ¡Cuán terrible es este lugar! No es otra cosa que casa de Dios, y puerta del cielo.", "words": [[0, 152530], [2, 152633], [7, 152853], [14, 153333], [16, 153533], [22, 154264], [28, 154545], [37, 154905], [40, 155385], [45, 155685], [52, 156489], [55, 156627], [58, 156807], [63, 157007], [68, 157367], [72, 157547], [77, 157807], [80, 158007], [86, 158267], [88, 158587], [95, 158947], [99, 159167]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 159981, "end": 169567, "text": "Y se levantó Jacob de mañana, y tomó la piedra que había puesto de cabecera, y la alzó por señal, y derramó aceite encima de ella.", "words": [[0, 159981], [2, 160097], [5, 160217], [13, 160717], [19, 161057], [22, 161357], [30, 161737], [32, 162017], [37, 162377], [40, 162497], [47, 163037], [51, 163177], [57, 163457], [64, 163757], [67, 164037], [77, 164717], [79, 165137], [82, 165317], [87, 165837], [91, 165977], [98, 166637], [100, 166997], [108, 167537], [115,